{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NIGHT OF THE WENDIGO</strong> is a Virtual Reality horror experience in which a peaceful day of hiking becomes a night of survival! The game is a very simple VR experience that is best enjoyed by taking turns with friends.<br><br>The player must survive the night using their rechargeable flashlight to fend against forest animals such as deer, wolves, and the legendary Wendigo.<br><br>- 10 to 20-minute playthrough.<br>- Endless Survival Mode!<br>- Simple, easy-to-understand gameplay.<br>- Scary, scripted sequences and potential threats from any direction.<br>- Roomscale experience. No need to worry about motion sickness!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good Luck!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/74ff2bc880ddfb1c3b24a9294ff81c1dc31090f3.jpg"},{"name":"Deer Blaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/291624b88f8438b9dcda2c74a416571d015ca7c7.jpg"},{"name":"Hungry Boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/e3bc76669ba427571ef4d17c39242d8b165ad0a3.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/f984ecee20edcc577a87799678d57366a9c361be.jpg"},{"name":"Survivalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/533b93c1cff7a4546a003a16b319a2f374620fce.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/c8036cc44b5425752f2415cad035b2dc2ad44c27.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/e302747e04cbaac11d2e3c3b2cd874ee4affce98.jpg"},{"name":"Apex Predator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/30255a43b5a30e24b908aacbfe354fd6c5396ef5.jpg"},{"name":"Big Boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/s